     * Whether the row following a transaction row is a continuation of that transaction, ie. a row
     * holding nothing but a further line of the description of the transaction. A row holding a
     * balance of its own is never a continuation row, it is a transaction of its own.
     */
    public static Boolean isDescriptionContinuationRow(Element element, BankTransactionHeaderIndex bankTransactionHeaderIndex) {
        Map<String, String> headerMap = headerDictionary()
        Elements rowElements = element.select("td")
